    "body": "- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\nI ran into an issue using the suggested method for tpope/vim-surround style mappings. The add mapping (`ys`) was still being made in visual mode, so it was adding a delay to visual yanking. \r\n\r\nMy suggestion is to add an optional extra mapping for visual_add. If it is not given then the mappings default to their previous behaviour.\r\n\r\nI think I've updated all relevant documentation. And all tests are passing. Hopefully I haven't missed anything.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2022-07-30T13:53:17Z",
    "comment_data": [],
